msgstr "| `/nightly <test_cases>` | 在 `main` 分支上运行 |"

msgid ""
"| `/nightly <test_cases> --branch <branch>` | Runs on the specified branch |"
msgstr "| `/nightly <test_cases> --branch <branch>` | 在指定分支上运行 |"

msgid ""
"| `/nightly <test_cases> --aop_enabled` | Enable AOP hooks (bisect / "
"classify) on failure |"
msgstr "| `/nightly <test_cases> --aop_enabled` | 失败时启用 AOP 钩子（二分/分类） |"

msgid ""
"| `/cherry-pick <target_branch>` | Cherry-pick onto the specified branch |"
msgstr "| `/cherry-pick <target_branch>` | 将提交拣选到指定分支 |"

msgid "| `/revert` | Revert this PR (no arguments needed) |"
msgstr "| `/revert` | 回退此 PR（无需参数） |"

msgid ""
"| `/e2e` | PR author, or users with triage+ permission on the repository |"
msgstr "| `/e2e` | PR 作者，或具有仓库 triage+ 权限的用户 |"

msgid ""
"| `/rerun` | PR author, or users with triage+ permission on the repository |"
msgstr "| `/rerun` | PR 作者，或具有仓库 triage+ 权限的用户 |"

msgid ""
"| `/cherry-pick` | PR author, or users with triage+ permission on the "
"repository |"
msgstr "| `/cherry-pick` | PR 作者，或具有仓库 triage+ 权限的用户 |"

msgid ""
"| `/revert` | PR author, or users with triage+ permission on the repository "
"|"
msgstr "| `/revert` | PR 作者，或具有仓库 triage+ 权限的用户 |"

msgid "| `/nightly` | Users with triage+ permission on the repository only |"
msgstr "| `/nightly` | 仅限具有仓库 triage+ 权限的用户 |"

msgid ""
"Re-run failed CI workflows on the current PR commit. Useful when CI jobs "
"failed or were cancelled due to infrastructure issues."
msgstr "重新运行当前PR提交上失败的CI工作流。当CI任务因基础设施问题失败或被取消时非常有用。"

msgid ""
"Only jobs that did not complete successfully are re-run (failed, cancelled, "
"timed out, or startup-failed). Jobs that already succeeded are left "
"untouched. Runs with `cancelled` / `timed_out` / `startup_failure` "
"conclusions are re-run per remaining job, and runs whose failure also "
"contains cancelled jobs (e.g. a vLLM matrix leg cancelled by fail-fast) are "
"handled the same way. Tests executed through reusable workflows (e.g. "
"`Selected Tests`) are re-run via their caller job and are not duplicated."
msgstr ""
"仅重新运行未成功完成的任务（失败、取消、超时或启动失败）。已成功的任务保持不变。结论为`cancelled` / `timed_out` / "
"`startup_failure`的运行将按剩余任务重新运行，失败中包含已取消任务（例如由fail-"
"fast取消的vLLM矩阵分支）的运行也以相同方式处理。通过可复用工作流（例如`Selected "
"Tests`）执行的测试将通过其调用方任务重新运行，不会重复执行。"

msgid "### `/cancel`"
msgstr "### `/cancel`"

msgid ""
"Force-cancel all workflow runs on the current PR commit. This cancels runs "
"directly triggered on the PR head commit, such as the automatic E2E CI "
"workflow (`pr_test.yaml`). Workflows triggered by slash commands (e.g., "
"`/e2e`, `/rerun`, `/nightly`) or downstream nightly/weekly workflows are "
"**not** affected, as those run on the `main` branch."
msgstr ""
"强制取消当前PR提交上的所有工作流运行。这会取消直接在PR头提交上触发的运行，例如自动E2E "
"CI工作流（`pr_test.yaml`）。由斜杠命令（例如`/e2e`、`/rerun`、`/nightly`）或下游夜间/每周工作流触发的工作流**不受**影响，因为这些运行在`main`分支上。"

msgid "**Scope:**"
msgstr "**范围：**"

msgid "| Cancelled | Not cancelled |"
msgstr "| 已取消 | 未取消 |"

msgid "| `pr_test.yaml` (E2E) — automatic PR CI | `/e2e` command runs |"
msgstr "| `pr_test.yaml`（E2E）— 自动PR CI | `/e2e`命令运行 |"

msgid "| `labeled_doctest.yaml` | `/rerun` command runs |"
msgstr "| `labeled_doctest.yaml` | `/rerun`命令运行 |"

msgid ""
"| `schedule_doc_linkcheck.yaml` | `/nightly` / `/weekly` command runs |"
msgstr "| `schedule_doc_linkcheck.yaml` | `/nightly` / `/weekly`命令运行 |"

msgid ""
"| `schedule_image_build_and_push.yaml` (if labeled) | Downstream "
"nightly/weekly test workflows |"
msgstr "| `schedule_image_build_and_push.yaml`（如果已标记） | 下游夜间/每周测试工作流 |"

msgid ""
"| `labeled_download_model_dataset.yaml` | Scheduled / `workflow_dispatch` / "
"`push` runs |"
msgstr ""
"| `labeled_download_model_dataset.yaml` | 定时 / `workflow_dispatch` / "
"`push`运行 |"

msgid ""
"> Note: This uses the `force-cancel` API endpoint, which can cancel runs "
"even when they are in a pending or queued state waiting for runners."
msgstr "> 注意：这使用`force-cancel` API端点，即使运行处于等待运行器的待处理或排队状态，也可以取消它们。"

msgid ""
"| `/cancel` | PR author, or users with triage+ permission on the repository "
"|"
msgstr "| `/cancel` | PR作者，或对仓库具有triage+权限的用户 |"
